> parse 0 < x < 10
((0 < x) && (x < 10))
  note: chained comparison read as a conjunction
> parse 1 < 2 < 3 < 4
1
  note: chained comparison read as a conjunction
> parse a < b <= c != d >= e > f
(((((a < b) && (b <= c)) && (c != d)) && (d >= e)) && (e > f))
  note: chained comparison read as a conjunction
> parse x == y == z
((x == y) && (y == z))
  note: chained comparison read as a conjunction
> parse 1 < x < 3 ? x : 0
(((1 < x) && (x < 3)) ? x : 0)
  note: chained comparison read as a conjunction
> parse a < b < c ? 1 : 2
(((a < b) && (b < c)) ? 1 : 2)
  note: chained comparison read as a conjunction
> parse 0 = x < 10
((x == 0) && (x < 10))
  note: '=' inside an expression read as '=='
  note: chained comparison read as a conjunction
> parse a < b = c
((a < b) && (b == c))
  note: '=' inside an expression read as '=='
  note: chained comparison read as a conjunction
> parse (0 < x) && (x < 10)
((0 < x) && (x < 10))
> parse 0 < x
(0 < x)
